        <p>A POISON FACTORY</p>
        <p>which malufact ures</p>
        <p>MILLIONS OF MI:;!ZOBES</p>
        <p>A most thriving manufactory for millions oT the deadliest microbes,is the human body. One's organs can only do a certain amount of work, so if we give them too much to do, in the way of digesting unsuitable food, or getting rid of contaminated air etc., and not taking enough fresh air and exercise to help them in their functions, poisonous matter is not eliminated, and is re-absorbed into the system, countless harmful germs being evolved which do their evil work in rendering you run- down, nervous, prostrated, thin and rumnic, and' bringing about serious stomach, kidney and other trouble. When troubles such as the above do occur, immediate recourse should be made to Or. Cassell's Tablets, the new and'effective remedy, lately made up from the prescription of .a noted specialist and sold by all chemists at the nominal price of lOid. This great family medicine, guaranteed pure and harmless, is in enormous 'demand just now, and is every day effecting hundreds of extraordinary cures in cases of nerve and physical exhaustion of every kind ; and as a ceqtain eradicator of poison- ous germs and matter and a builder up of sound healthy flesh, blood, bone, and muscle, Dr. Cassell's Tablets are superior to anything else.</p>
